{"title": "Legendary Persistence", "pageid": 30436, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Persistence", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Legendary Persistence</b> is a passive feature that grants permanent resistance to physical damage and a bonus to saving throws.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resistance_(Condition)\" title=\"Resistance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance_(Condition)\" title=\"Resistance (Condition)\">Resistance</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Blade Ward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blade Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Blade_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blade_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Blade Ward (Condition)\">Blade Ward</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Persistence\" title=\"Armour of Persistence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Armour_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Armour_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Armour_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Armour_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Armour_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Armour_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Armour_of_Persistence_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Persistence\" title=\"Armour of Persistence\">Armour of Persistence</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200023\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 sec